{"id":"41bf4c1fd4079b59","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-computable-structure.md","title":"Computable Structure","display":"df-computable-structure — Computable Structure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-computable-structure","aliases":["68-df-computable-structure"],"display":"df-computable-structure — Computable Structure","depends_on":["[[68-df-structure]]","[[68-df-recursive-set]]","[[68-df-recursive-function]]","[[68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"Local computable-presentation extension of §11 p.33 / PDF 42; no source theorem located","verification_status":"external-source-unverified","source_proof_status":"definition-reviewed","external_verification_status":"unverified","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-computable-structure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-computable-structure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-computable-structure — Computable Structure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"27dbc26143606cc1\" href=\"?note=27dbc26143606cc1\" title=\"68-df-structure\">68-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7fc8baae87b873a3\" href=\"?note=7fc8baae87b873a3\" title=\"68-df-recursive-set\">68-df-recursive-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a82d826d433dcff3\" href=\"?note=a82d826d433dcff3\" title=\"68-df-recursive-function\">68-df-recursive-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5e61d0905238a638\" href=\"?note=5e61d0905238a638\" title=\"68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy\">68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Local computable-presentation extension of §11 p.33 / PDF 42; no source theorem located"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"external-source-unverified"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"definition-reviewed"},{"key":"external_verification_status","html":"unverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\)</span> 是候选集合；下式通过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A=(\\sigma,D,\\rho,\\phi)\">\\(\\mathfrak A=(\\sigma,D,\\rho,\\phi)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma=(I,J,\\alpha,\\beta)\">\\(\\sigma=(I,J,\\alpha,\\beta)\\)</span> 绑定各分量。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Structure}\">\\(\\mathrm{Structure}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"27dbc26143606cc1\" href=\"?note=27dbc26143606cc1\" title=\"68-df-structure\">68-df-structure</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Recursive}\">\\(\\mathrm{Recursive}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TotalRec}\">\\(\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Recursive}^{(k)}\">\\(\\mathrm{Recursive}^{(k)}\\)</span> 见所列直接依赖。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompStruct}\">\\(\\mathrm{CompStruct}\\)</span> 在下式定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompStruct}(\\mathfrak A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists I,J\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^I\\;\\exists\\beta\\in\\mathbb N^J\\;\\exists\\sigma\\;\\exists D\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\rho,\\phi\\;\\left(\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\sigma=(I,J,\\alpha,\\beta)\\land\\mathfrak A=(\\sigma,D,\\rho,\\phi)\\land\\mathrm{Structure}(\\mathfrak A)\\land D\\in\\mathrm{Recursive}\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\rho(i)\\in\\mathrm{Recursive}^{(\\alpha(i))})\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall j\\in J\\;\\exists g\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^{\\beta(j)}}\\;\\forall\\vec a\\in D^{\\beta(j)}\\;(g(\\vec a)=\\phi(j)(\\vec a))\\end{aligned}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{CompStruct}(\\mathfrak A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists I,J\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^I\\;\\exists\\beta\\in\\mathbb N^J\\;\\exists\\sigma\\;\\exists D\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\rho,\\phi\\;\\left(\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\sigma=(I,J,\\alpha,\\beta)\\land\\mathfrak A=(\\sigma,D,\\rho,\\phi)\\land\\mathrm{Structure}(\\mathfrak A)\\land D\\in\\mathrm{Recursive}\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\rho(i)\\in\\mathrm{Recursive}^{(\\alpha(i))})\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall j\\in J\\;\\exists g\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^{\\beta(j)}}\\;\\forall\\vec a\\in D^{\\beta(j)}\\;(g(\\vec a)=\\phi(j)(\\vec a))\\end{aligned}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是有限签名结构的可计算呈示定义。基本关系是相应元数的递归关系，基本运算要求存在全 N 上的递归扩张，原运算仍只定义于 D 的元组；D 递归且非空时，这与在 D 上算法可计算等价。有限签名避免无限符号族逐个可计算与统一可计算之间的差异。原书 §11 只定义一般结构；所供全文未定位此可计算结构定义，故保留为外部待核验扩展，不把本地定义审阅当作原书来源核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"27dbc26143606cc1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursive-set","status":"resolved","id":"7fc8baae87b873a3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursive-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"a82d826d433dcff3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"5e61d0905238a638","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"27dbc26143606cc1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A$ 是候选集合；下式通过 $\\mathfrak A=(\\sigma,D,\\rho,\\phi)$、$\\sigma=(I,J,\\alpha,\\beta)$ 绑定各分量。$\\mathrm{Structure}$ 见 [[68-df-structure]]。$\\mathrm{Recursive}$、$\\mathrm{TotalRec}$、$\\mathrm{Recursive}^{(k)}$ 见所列直接依赖。$\\mathrm{CompStruct}$ 在下式定义。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A=(\\sigma,D,\\rho,\\phi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma=(I,J,\\alpha,\\beta)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Structure}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Recursive}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TotalRec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Recursive}^{(k)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompStruct}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompStruct}(\\mathfrak A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists I,J\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^I\\;\\exists\\beta\\in\\mathbb N^J\\;\\exists\\sigma\\;\\exists D\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\rho,\\phi\\;\\left(\\begin{aligned}&\\sigma=(I,J,\\alpha,\\beta)\\land\\mathfrak A=(\\sigma,D,\\rho,\\phi)\\land\\mathrm{Structure}(\\mathfrak A)\\land D\\in\\mathrm{Recursive}\\\\&\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\rho(i)\\in\\mathrm{Recursive}^{(\\alpha(i))})\\\\&\\land\\forall j\\in J\\;\\exists g\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^{\\beta(j)}}\\;\\forall\\vec a\\in D^{\\beta(j)}\\;(g(\\vec a)=\\phi(j)(\\vec a))\\end{aligned}\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":2218,"backlinks":[{"id":"93be4ecb17896d81","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5e050274b891eb53","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"879b42e91247e55b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-60","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-computable-structure|df-computable-structure — Computable Structure]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-computable-structure]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-62","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-computable-structure|df-computable-structure — Computable Structure]]"}],"outgoing":["27dbc26143606cc1","7fc8baae87b873a3","a82d826d433dcff3","5e61d0905238a638"]}